        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106114",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Building on more than 60 years of service to pets and the people who love and care for them, we serve our customers as a fully-integrated, omnichannel provider of pet products, services, and solutions.",
        "start_character": 170,
        "end_character": 371
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106114",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106114-a9a2d16449905f28",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106114",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In these states and jurisdictions, we provide management and other administrative services to veterinary practices rather than owning such practices or directly employing the veterinarians providing medical care.",
        "start_character": 19949,
        "end_character": 20161
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106114",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106114-a9a2d16449905f28",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106114",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Layered onto our in-store and services offerings, we are focused on continually improving both our digital capabilities as well as our membership offering and creating a digital-to-store experience designed to minimize friction for our customers.",
        "start_character": 2254,
        "end_character": 2500
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106114",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106114-a9a2d16449905f28",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106114",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We integrate our product offering with our services business, comprised of veterinary care, grooming, and training, with a focus on treating the whole pet, including their physical, mental, and social well-being.",
        "start_character": 1310,
        "end_character": 1522
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106114",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106114-a9a2d16449905f28",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106114",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We strive for our partners to grow and develop in their careers, and offer competitive compensation and benefits programs, incentive compensation, and a range of health and wellness offerings.",
        "start_character": 7962,
        "end_character": 8154
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106114",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106114-a9a2d16449905f28",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106114",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we operate approximately 150 pet care centers in Mexico and 2 in Chile through a joint venture.",
        "start_character": 647,
        "end_character": 756
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106114",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106114-a9a2d16449905f28",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106114",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although we believe that we have structured our operations to comply with our understanding of the veterinary medicine laws of each state and jurisdiction in which we operate, interpretive legal precedent and regulatory guidance varies by jurisdiction and is often sparse and not fully developed.",
        "start_character": 20162,
        "end_character": 20458
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106114",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106114-a9a2d16449905f28",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106114",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "From attracting bilingual talent that help us serve multicultural market segments to finding experiences that help us innovate in a competitive and changing industry, we continue to evaluate and enhance our recruiting and development strategies to find and build the best talent possible.",
        "start_character": 9184,
        "end_character": 9472
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106114",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106114-a9a2d16449905f28",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106114",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, all of the states in which we operate veterinary facilities impose various registration permit and/or licensing requirements.",
        "start_character": 20459,
        "end_character": 20597
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106114",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106114-a9a2d16449905f28",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106114",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In recent years, we have introduced foundational leadership development training for all new General Managers and above, provided comprehensive pet health and wellness certifications in all pet care centers, and continuously develop our partners’ customer engagement skills.",
        "start_character": 10852,
        "end_character": 11126
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106114",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106114-a9a2d16449905f28",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106114",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are able to benefit from certain structural advantages compared to stand-alone veterinary care providers by integrating our hospitals into existing pet care centers.",
        "start_character": 1687,
        "end_character": 1855
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106114",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106114-a9a2d16449905f28",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106114",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We invest significant resources to attract, develop, and retain top talent.",
        "start_character": 10776,
        "end_character": 10851
